22 0 obj
<< /A 337 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating ELISA screening, Inter-Laboratory ELISA comparison and DRG immunofluorescence validation for anti-FGFR3 antibodies across centers. Screening Center 2:  5.9% SNN, 8.3% SFN, 4.4% FMS, 4.0% healthy controls positive. Inter-laboratory comparison shows 81% concordance between both centers. Antibody validation through DRG binding assays confirms 17/26 \(65.3%\) sera as positive. ) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 16 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
23 0 obj
<< /A 338 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows a scatter plot comparing OD440 values between two centers, with significant differences marked by asterisks. Panel B displays a correlation scatter plot of OD values between centers one and two, with a correlation coefficient of 0.68. Panel C presents a bar chart showing the percentage of positive samples compared between two centers. Panel D includes quadruple staining \(serum, anti-FGF3, peripherin and DAPI\) on DRG using healthy control serum. Panel E shows similar stained images using a FGFR3 seropositive SFN serum instead, with strong staining of small DRG and colocalization to commercial markers. ) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 18 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
